Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:12.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make a human friend you can trust
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:14.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And tell them your elfin identity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After the third day of July
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open Task 3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:23.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Work with your friend on task three. So that's your second task?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:27.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your job is already done
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:28.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:33.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that mean Xiaohei can stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:34.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.94,0:00:36.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it either
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:40.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why would they ask you to work with humans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:43.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can Xiaobai finish the task? When the task was set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:46.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you considered that Xiaobai is a ten-year-old primary school student?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:48.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can't, brother will help Xiaohei~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There seems to be no limit to the number of people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:53.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll see by then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.04,0:00:54.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The third day of July is tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:57.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can Xiaohei take full human form?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:00:58.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not yet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:00.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, just stay in cat form
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:04.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your white hair and cat ears being seen by other people is always a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, can't you wear a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:08.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'm more at ease in cat form
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:11.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did not the minister say that it was possible to find a form changer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.64,0:01:12.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's only external
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.84,0:01:16.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like to slowly get better on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:20.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you are totally cute in the cat-ear form
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.84,0:01:27.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey~Shanxing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know. Isn't it early
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:31.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are\NWhat are you doing here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:37.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid something's wrong with you. You're not ready yet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:39.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't there more than an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:42.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can get in early
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:46.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I haven't come, you won't be able to synchronize with me and log in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:46.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:50.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't bring your own console?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:53.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it can be played by four people at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:58.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big brother should come play too! Shanxing said it is super fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:01:59.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All Living Creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This ah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:01.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you know about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:05.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've seen it before. It seems interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:06.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, then
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:09.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei you should play too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:11.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have been waiting for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:19.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know what the game is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:22.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know how popular it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How on earth did you get the limited edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Let's go straight to it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:30.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One receiver per person, wear it first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:38.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The terminal must be connected to the Internet
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Setting it up to log into room 1
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:44.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can open settings at 9:30 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This game is to be played in bed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.84,0:02:52.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just lie down and press this button on the side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.64,0:02:55.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you the rest after we go in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:10.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome to 'All Living Creatures'
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:14.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please state your user name
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:20.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please select your character's race
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:24.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a lot. Hey, aren't these animals
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:27.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the game feature of 'All Living Creatures'
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I change it after I've chosen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:34.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It cannot be changed without deleting the character
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:37.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, then I'll stick with being human
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:44.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to create a new persona or use your own appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:45.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Use my own appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is a change of clothing required?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:49.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope. That's it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.04,0:03:57.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a little bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:04:00.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you be setting up a subsidiary account?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:05.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a special option based on your particular situation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:06.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:09.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the 'All Living Creatures' 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:13.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please wait on the online platform for the game to start 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're here, Xiaohei
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:21.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing that cats can play? Well, that's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:24.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I had known, I would have brought Huangshou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:25.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:28.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've all chosen the human form. How boring
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:32.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's gonna happen. What kind of game is this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:34.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a virtual reality game
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:39.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can perfectly trigger our senses to create realistic effects
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.54,0:04:41.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This feels too real...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:46.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't know until the game starts
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The game didn't reveal anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:52.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But just because of this revolutionary genre, it's selling like crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:54.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the launch was very sensational
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:56.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you feel it at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.75,0:04:58.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:04:59.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,oh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:02.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like we have a mountain between us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:04.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now the game is about to be revealed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:08.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you can actually choose different creatures to play
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:09.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:15.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it seems hard to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this really a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.64,0:05:20.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's amazing. It just feels real
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:22.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the pain is mild
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:25.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,well
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How on earth does this work
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome to 'All Living Creatures'
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:36.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, MT,  am the guide of this game, I will explain the game for you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This game is a new open world
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The specific goals will be revealed as you play
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:44.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please check the official website for updates
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just one thing to emphasize before the game begins
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about the concept of life in games
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:52.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are the rules you need to know before you play
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:06:00.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a character dies and does not receive Resurrection within 10 seconds, the character will be deleted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Deleted!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, the game character
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:04.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,corresponds to real people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:06.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Each person can only have one character
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:12.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When a character dies, it will now refresh to a new character after a 30 minute cooldown
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:19.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please protect yourself just like in the real world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm... I'm not sure what's happening
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:27.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, the menu will be summoned by thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To optimize the game experience
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:32.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only team members can see this interface
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:33.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't have any questions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:38.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can be recognized as ready at any time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:40.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At 10 o'clock sharp, it is the time to officially enter the game
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:42.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, no tutorial
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:43.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:44.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:46.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get separated after login~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:48.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The landing site is expected to be very crowded
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It should be dangerous until you are familiar with the environment
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're already Main Dialogue friends
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:55.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if lost, we can still find each other
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Under the name, there is a experience bar
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:06:59.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Filling it will level up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leveling up gives you skill points
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:02.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Used to learn skills
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have tasks to do and I should be able to pick them up here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:05.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it is empty
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:08.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing in the mall right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:10.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the combat support system
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:13.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll know more once we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay? Let's get ready to log in
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:19.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, are there any server choices?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:23.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. All players are on the same server in this game
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:28.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four levels so many players actually this does not shunt
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to log in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Log in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:55.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we... In the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, but why is there no one there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:18.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:26.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxing... What's the matter with you? New message...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,(After entering the game, I can't talk anymore!!!!!)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahahahahahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:34.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course you don't know how to talk! That's more realistic
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:42.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get familiar with the controls first
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It only shows three kilometers at the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means you have to explore the world first
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:51.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei you don't understand right? I'll read it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:52.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see someone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:54.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ah
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:57.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He ran...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he saw the size of our group
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:03.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, do you feel the presence of ling (spirit)?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:13.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd seen it on the goblin forum before so I thought I'd give it a try
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now it is the hottest topic in the forum
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:22.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an elfin game
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:57.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, it looks exactly like the real world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:03.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:07.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:14.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, right now there are more than 10 million players and rising
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:19.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are so many players on the same server and we barely see anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.17,0:10:25.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means that the world is too big! Opening a world chat is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:42.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:44.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,(I can't summon Heixiu)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because this body is not our real body
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:51.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though we can still feel and keep spirit energy,  they're much weaker than in reality
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:55.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this a monster of the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother is so strong~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've leveled up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See, level two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that your real ability
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It also works in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.84,0:11:32.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This game has something to do with Elfins
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:35.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder! it's so amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:38.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxing was defeated, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:39.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's log out
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, how do you get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:48.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is. It says quit and then do this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:52.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It says that next time we will enter where we exited so mind your safety
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:55.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxing, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:58.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's horrific. Being stepped to death is horrific
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, were you killed by that monster too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:03.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No brother got rid of him
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:05.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did he manage that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, that might be hard to say
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a secret. We can't tell
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, a secret. Then forget it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:16.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it stranger to say it's a secret
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:20.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really~ you don't have to reveal a secret but you can't tell a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxing is Xiaobai's best friend! She can keep a secret with us
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:31.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:41.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh Elfin... An Elfin game... So that's it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:46.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold to Huangshou (her cat) in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People are so accepting these days
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,big brother is still big brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:53.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei is still Xiaohei, nothing changed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.64,0:12:55.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:58.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing that's changed now is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:01.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only care about gaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:05.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Returning to the main topic, the death penalty in this game is too heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:08.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't enter the game for another half hour
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:08.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.34,0:13:14.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the meantime we can collect information
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:15.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is Laofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Went to play games
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking about fighting every day... It suits him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:24.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are also rarely this at peace
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:24.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:27.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,AHH! I'M SO MAD!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:29.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just when it became fun! They camped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:33.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that Mr. Fu also likes this game
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:36.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At first, Elfins have an advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they may not be so happy after a while
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:43.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this game made specifically for Elfins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:45.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just one reason
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:51.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All sentient creatures in this game are actual players
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:55.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The animals we just saw were actual players
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:58.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aha, this is amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:13:59.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why it's called the 'All Living Creatures'
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:04.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, it was our limited edition privilege to choose a race
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's limited edition
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Internet also talked about the factions and the red-tagging
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:15.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Characters start out as part of the faction of their birth location\NWhat is that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:19.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a human character kills another human in the same faction, your name turns red
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:21.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Other races are not affected
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:23.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just don't know what a reddened name does...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:26.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still don't have much of a clue about gameplay 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:30.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Currently on the forum, it's mostly dead people like me who have limited knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The interface supports cash transactions
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice that but we'll look into that later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:43.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rule of deleting a character after death has blown up on the Internet
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:45.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is even a petition now to change it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:47.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, so many people signed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:49.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will that change the rules of the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:50.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother has insider's information
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:55.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are discussions on the Elfin forum
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:58.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The administrator responded explicitly that this rule will not be changed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:04.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice it before, but now I realize the moderator is Cali
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:05.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An Elfin's game...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For Elfins to create a game...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:09.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is their purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:10.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To make money!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:14.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't such rigid rules cause player resentment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rules are not designed to make money
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:21.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is to make the world as authentic as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:25.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But because of the advanced nature of the game, not making money is impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:29.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because there is a cap on the number of people I want to have high-quality players
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:34.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The people who give up are not my target audience, so it is better that they leave
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:36.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An official statement is out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a tough stance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.74,0:15:44.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,50 million sets sold?! Isn't that a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:48.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Based on sales, it would be one of the top ten consoles in console history
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:54.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But no console has ever added a limited number after 50 million
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:57.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such an attitude should provoke a strong backlash from players
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:58.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:00.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a seller's market
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:03.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the set rules are changed just because someone objects to them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.14,0:16:05.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is the fun in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how high a character's level or ability, once defeated, it all zeroes out
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:13.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Putting like this, it is indeed the most realistic rule
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:18.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen a large MMO brave enough to implement this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this rule is very interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:23.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only the player who accepts this can truly enjoy the game
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:27.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a game, there is only fun when there is difficulty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel my hype burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:31.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you feel your boiling blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:35.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, time's up. Let's move on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.14,0:16:40.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,yo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:42.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you a bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:44.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can reselect your species after you die
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:45.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm trying out the game first
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:49.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys change clothes? Nobody dresses like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:06.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are so many people over there~
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:08.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems to be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:10.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighting a Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:15.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, there are even bosses in this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.84,0:17:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah Subscribe to Watcher 404 they say
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:22.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,AHHHH That hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:28.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec! Wait! Let's talk it out! You're a player too right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:31.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,FOR REAL? HOW DID YOU BECOME A BOSS?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:34.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Players are randomly asked if they want to be the boss
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:39.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Designate a time and place they have to be and give them extra abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are are free for the rest of the time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that create issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe at first
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But as they get to know what a boss is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't be a big problem
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your Boss identity was given at random, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:57.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's make a deal. How about $2,000 for me to beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:03.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,HOLY SH*T! HOW SHAMELESS! THIS IS A BUG!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:29.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a quiet day
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:44.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Item get! Hahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are pay to win players in every game
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:50.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he bought it without knowing what he's getting
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:51.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha\NHa ha ha. We can't think of that. That's it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:53.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say~ Can't we just rob him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:54.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:57.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the past, items were bound or drop-rate issues
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:19:00.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The death mechanics here probably drop all items
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.59,0:19:03.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It increases the likeliness of combat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, it feels real
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:12.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we can pick our race, so can we pick the Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:14.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can try it next time
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:15.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you notice it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.59,0:19:16.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The person getting ganged is becoming stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:29.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.59,0:19:30.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:34.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:56.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was exciting... I thought I was a goner for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:59.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What item did he get? So powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:03.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that we're wiped out, we'll have to wait another half hour
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:06.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This game is so difficult. Even brother got defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:09.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That guy was probably leveled up a lot during combat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.09,0:20:12.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's keep searching for information
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:14.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, next time choose the human form
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.73,0:20:17.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Under the present condition, you should have more control over your abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:20.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, sure enough, he was reported
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:24.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The boss of the game was bribed, dropping high-class items
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:27.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The official response was that this was also part of gameplay and will not to interfere
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.79,0:20:29.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the boss will be recorded as an undutiful boss
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:31.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He won't have a chance to be a boss again
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.39,0:20:38.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the fastest levelers have reached level 50
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:42.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The imbalance in this game is too exaggerated, how did they do it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:43.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What level are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.09,0:20:46.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,level zero...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:49.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it's a fun game
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mealtime~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:57.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone has already sorted out the experience data
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:21:01.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To level up from 1 requires 1 XP and level 2 requires 2 XP
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.79,0:21:04.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same applies for higher levels, looks pretty simple
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:07.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But because all the experience comes from fighting among players
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:09.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leveling is very difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.09,0:21:12.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The amount of XP a player gets when defeating someone is not set in stone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get 30% of your opponent's total experience points
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taking 1 XP as the bottom line
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:21.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At lvl 10 you get the ability 'eye of experience' and can see the opponent's level
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:26.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now only two hours after server opening, there is already a 50-level gap
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:27.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Following the logic of accumulated experience
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:30.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's already killed the equivalent of over 1000 players
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:31.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That many!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:34.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, the people who were defeated must have included high ranking players
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.39,0:21:38.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the actual number of people killed was a few hundred at most
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.29,0:21:40.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that's still a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.29,0:21:41.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:42.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an extreme case
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:47.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They probably acquired mass destruction skills or weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.19,0:21:49.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The player level is destined to be distributed in pyramid form
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no balance in this game at all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now there are several types of gameplay that have been summarized
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.19,0:22:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Battle of nations, building operations, scenery sightseeing, and hunting or be-hunted
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.59,0:22:06.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So how are we gonna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.21,0:22:07.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's start with surviving
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect a game master like myself to be in such a mess
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.99,0:22:14.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get into the game
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:20.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time we're in a town. So many people~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.19,0:22:29.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This city is so ordinary I thought there would be some cool settings
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.59,0:22:31.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is now the time to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:31.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.89,0:22:36.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do we encounter this everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.12,0:22:40.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What level do you need to be that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.05,0:22:41.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to be level 10 to see his level
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Woah... So fast
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.89,0:22:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.19,0:22:53.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he leveling up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.19,0:23:02.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is probably a high level skill
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:21.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's exciting...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.49,0:23:24.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.89,0:23:30.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such shame! This is the first time I got owned so badly in a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.99,0:23:33.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it was really fun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.29,0:23:35.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be more experienced when we get back in
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.19,0:23:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I have to go home
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.99,0:23:40.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us continue tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.09,0:23:41.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:44.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning we will go to do a task for Xiaohei
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:17.66,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.66,0:24:22.40,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:27.10,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.10,0:24:33.30,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:39.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.45,0:24:44.25,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.25,0:24:48.93,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.93,0:24:55.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.45,0:25:06.77,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:12.19,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.19,0:25:17.23,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.23,0:25:28.46,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.46,0:25:34.01,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.01,0:25:40.85,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
